{"id": "86332", "name": "אי-שוויון עם ערך מוחלט וחזקה רביעית – |c − 2x⁴| ≤ d (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following inequality:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} . \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as <code dir=\"ltr\">x&gt;5</code> and/or <code dir=\"ltr\">x&lt;=13</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Use \\(|u|\\le a \\iff -a\\le u\\le a\\), isolate \\(x^4\\), then take the fourth root, remembering that \\(x\\) can be negative.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Removing the absolute value</b><br>As<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p>Then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} \\le {{CT:2}}\\mbox{ and }{{CT:1}} \\ge {{CT:3}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Isolating \\(x^4\\)</b><br>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} \\le {{CT:2}}+{{CT:5}}\\mbox{ and }{{CT:4}} \\ge {{CT:3}}+{{CT:5}}. \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}} \\le {{CT:6}}\\mbox{ and }{{CT:4}} \\ge {{CT:7}}. \\]</p>Dividing through by 2 gives<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:8}} \\le {{CT:9}}\\mbox{ and }{{CT:8}} \\ge {{CT:10}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Taking the fourth root</b><br>Taking the 4<sup>th</sup> root gives<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:11}}\\ge -{{CT:12}}\\mbox{ and }{{CT:11}}\\le {{CT:12}}\\mbox{ and }\\left({{CT:11}} \\ge {{CT:13}}\\mbox{ or }{{CT:11}} \\le -{{CT:13}}\\right) \\]</p>This is entered as<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left({{CT:11}}&gt;={{CT:14}} \\mbox{ and } {{CT:11}}&lt;=-1\\right) \\mbox{ or } \\left({{CT:11}}&gt;= 1 \\mbox{ and } {{CT:11}}&lt;={{CT:15}}\\right) \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": 